<title>USA: Suburban holders pass Fifth Third merger.</title>
<headline>Suburban holders pass Fifth Third merger.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suburban Bancorp said Tuesday its stockholders approved the company's pending agreement to merge with Fifth Third Bancorp in a deal worth $31.8 million.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the agreement, Suburban will convert each of its shares into 0.36536 of a share of Fifth Third common stock.</p>
<p>The conversion follows Fifth Third's three-for-two stock split in the form of a 50-percent stock dividend, it added.</p>
<p>The two companies announced their plans to merger in March.</p>
</text>
